  // ---------------------------------------------------------------- views: Filter and Display for every list (10C)
  // Every list (listView) gets the same two menus in the bar, unless the page turns them off (spec.controls: false):
  //   Filter   which rows show: by its groups (status), its labels, the person, the date, and words in the row; several
  //            at once; each one on shows as a chip above the list with an x, and Clear all (Baymard: 72% of the sites
