  // ================================================================ page: Inbox (everything waiting for a person)
  // As Linear's Inbox: one list of what needs you, grouped by what each asks of you (a decision, a check before it goes
  // out, a fix, a customer to act on, something to know), each row opening beside the list with everything needed to
  // deal with it there. J and K move, Enter opens, X selects several to approve, send or skip together.
  const INBOX_TABS = [["all", "All"], ["decide", "Decide"], ["check", "To check"], ["fix", "Fix"]];
  // page modules add their own groups to the top of the Inbox (team.js: mentions, work given to you, due reminders):
